            "notes": "Round 1, I choose to heal. That's why  [Multiball](item_5d0e4135-f4e1-42fb-991a-417643064560) is my personal pick, 3 heal orbs keep you and your team out of danger.\n\nIf you still want to dps at least a little bit, you can pick  [Cross-Orbal](item_e567bb63-527f-4c72-8ba1-dc59be1a0dc1) instead. Just remember to aim at your team through your opponents when using orbs, so the heal orb can still heal, and the damage orb can still damage. Very useful. \n\nFor your abilties, it's nothing you haven't seen on other heroes.\n [Power Playbook](item_6d8803cf-baa7-46ee-af91-51e7f2301418)  is mandatory. For survival, I pick  [Shady Spectacles](item_ef9bb72f-a56c-4fb6-a552-5abce0b943d7) , but picking  [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) is alright too. \n [Winning Attitude](item_8714087c-c078-4619-a2ef-327bc6edaa69) isn't the greatest idea, but I still like using it over something like  [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) because I tend to attempt stupid plays for no good reason.\n\nI'm only going to say it here, but it's a good idea to play for bounties. The extra cash can be pretty helpful.",
