            "notes": "Sell everything if you need to. Keep the greens if you can. \n [Smart Orbs](item_47f5985c-9b63-40d2-938b-63a22154b9be) is surprisingly powerful, and is pretty much used in every single orb build you'll find on this website.\n [Nano Cola](item_79b22609-8046-4a8a-a5a2-bb49cd7e11c6) is just generic ability power, but it's an ability based build, so whatever... Still useful.\nIf you somehow have over $14,000, I like to take  [Energized Bracers](item_f83a1d9e-91f8-4d2c-bd62-c673b8d9fd2e) over the greens, because haha all blue am I right\n\nYour ultimate gets a good bit stronger now. I tend to ult the second I get it, but if I get it before a teamfight, I'm using it the second that teamfight starts. You can raw DPS with it if you want, it gets ridiculous very soon.",
