            "notes": "Pray you have enough money saved (It gets a bit pricey without 10k every round) and get  [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505) Not just for the secondary effect (although that is the main reason), because the cooldown reduction and extra ability power on top is nice to have. Super underrated imo.\n\nTake  [Cross-Orbal](item_e567bb63-527f-4c72-8ba1-dc59be1a0dc1) or  [Multiball](item_5d0e4135-f4e1-42fb-991a-417643064560) , whatever you didn't pick on round 1.\n\nNow you have  [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505). Oopsie poopsie, one of the most lethal ults you can possibly have.\n\nI'm just going to assume that you haven't sold the blue ones for Cybervenom. As I said, pricey build.",
