            "notes": "[Phantasm](item_21ed9c3d-7a54-438f-9188-f21fd7a7dbfb) makes your dives even stronger, because you can leave a heal orb for your team when you dive, and leave a damage orb for their team when you back out. I don't make it to round 5 often (because either we sweep or get swept) but I can't go without phantasm.\n\nTake  [Champion's Kit](item_8682f8c7-8811-439b-8d50-fa81cd43ddce) . Even if you need to sell Nano Cola. If you need to sell Nano Cola, buy whatever ability power you can get in blue, or green.\nDepending on what you can afford, take\n [Multi-Tool](item_5ba8d94e-f2f3-44b7-8773-025fc6ed7c56) / [Energized Bracers](item_f83a1d9e-91f8-4d2c-bd62-c673b8d9fd2e)  (They have similar strength)\n [Custom Stock](item_17d633af-8bcc-4893-b865-be0a7bc66fe2) \n [Power Playbook](item_6d8803cf-baa7-46ee-af91-51e7f2301418) in that order, top down. Ability power good! No ability power bad.",
